{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players, get your skates on and get ready to get physical. Twisted Jam is a game where you must score the disk into the opponent's goal. Team up with friends and push your way to victory. If pushing doesn't work, try slide tackling. In short, its a fast-paced arcade sports game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, you'll be able to experience the tutorial and custom games. Join up with your friends and battle it out. Each map has unique characteristics, so use them to your advantage.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736740?t=1748440862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736740?t=1748440862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736740/db5ec698bb2826d95869b02ae725c5cb0f32113f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748440862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736740/db5ec698bb2826d95869b02ae725c5cb0f32113f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748440862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature content includes destruction of character models by collision of object and other characters."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players, get your skates on and get ready to get physical. Twisted Jam is a game where you must score the disk into the opponent's goal. Team up with friends and push your way to victory. If pushing doesn't work, try slide tackling. In short, its a fast-paced arcade sports game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, you'll be able to experience the